				'- Ibn Kathīr, <em>Tafsīr al-Qurʾān al-ʿaẓīm</em>.',
				'- Ibn Isḥāq, <em>Sīrat Rasūl Allāh</em>, trans. Alfred Guillaume as <em>The Life of Muhammad</em>.',
				'## Secondary sources',
				'- Raymond E. Brown, <em>An Introduction to the New Testament</em>.',
